  "Reading your plan": "查看规划",
  "Currency crafting": "货币制作",
  "Rerolls unlocked affixes of a Rare item; locked affixes are preserved. The current operation does not accept Epic items.": "重新生成稀有物品未锁定的词缀；锁定词缀保留。当前操作不适用于史诗物品。",
  "Attempts to reroll numeric values of existing affixes while keeping their types. Locked affixes retain their values.": "尝试重掷现有词缀的数值，同时保留类型。锁定词缀的数值保持不变。",
  "Adds one compatible affix to a Rare item with room under its rarity cap.": "为未达到稀有度词缀上限的稀有物品添加一条兼容词缀。",
  "Changes a Common (Normal) item to Rare and rolls its affixes.": "将普通物品变为稀有物品并生成词缀。",
  "Rerolls unlocked affixes of an Uncommon (Magic) item; locked affixes are preserved.": "重新生成优秀（魔法）物品未锁定的词缀；锁定词缀保留。",
  "Removes one randomly selected unlocked affix. An item with no unlocked affixes cannot use it.": "随机移除一条未锁定词缀。没有未锁定词缀的物品无法使用。",
  "Adds one compatible affix to an Uncommon (Magic) item with room under its rarity cap.": "为未达到稀有度词缀上限的优秀（魔法）物品添加一条兼容词缀。",
  "Used through the Talent Atlas refund action; it cannot be applied to an item in inventory.": "通过天赋图谱的退还操作使用；不能用于背包中的物品。",
  "Changes a Common (Normal) item to Uncommon (Magic) and rolls its affixes.": "将普通物品变为优秀（魔法）物品并生成词缀。",
  "Changes an Uncommon (Magic) item to Rare, keeps existing affixes and adds one compatible affix.": "将优秀（魔法）物品变为稀有物品，保留现有词缀并添加一条兼容词缀。",
  "Successful item operations consume one owned orb. Consumables cannot use item orbs; compatible pools, modifier groups and available slots still constrain results.": "成功的物品操作消耗一枚持有的宝珠。消耗品不能使用装备宝珠；兼容词缀池、词缀组和可用槽位仍会限制结果。",
  "Refunds consume 1 Orb of Regret for a minor, 2 for a notable or 3 for a keystone. Starting origins cannot be refunded; remaining learned nodes must keep their required connections. The node's allocation cost returns as talent points and its granted skill is unequipped.": "退还小型天赋消耗1枚悔悟宝珠，显著天赋2枚，关键天赋3枚。职业起点不可退还；剩余已学习节点必须保留所需连接。节点的分配消耗以天赋点返还，授予的技能会被卸下。",
  "Choose an orb to inspect its source-reviewed target and operation. Outcomes depend on compatible item pools and modifier groups.": "选择宝珠以查看经源代码核对的目标与操作。结果取决于兼容的物品词缀池和词缀组。",
  "Authored synthesis recipes exist, but their player-facing production path is unconfirmed. They are excluded from this playable guide.": "已有编写的合成配方，但面向玩家的制作流程尚未确认，因此未纳入本指南。",
  "Common items roll no affixes. Uncommon and Rare rolls are constrained by the rarity limits below, the base item's prefix and suffix capacities, compatible pools and modifier groups. Candidate eligibility never guarantees a particular roll.": "普通物品不会生成词缀。魔法与稀有物品的生成受下列稀有度上限、基础物品的前后缀容量、兼容词缀池和词缀组限制。候选词缀符合条件并不保证一定生成。",
  "The candidate list applies item type, item tier, pool tier cap, prefix and suffix capacity, local base-stat restrictions and weapon damage type. Existing modifier groups and rarity still constrain an actual item.": "候选列表考虑物品类型、阶级、词缀池阶级上限、前后缀容量、局部基础属性限制和武器伤害类型。实际物品仍受现有词缀组和稀有度限制。",
  "Each class starts at its own free origin. A class entry can connect through that origin. Ordinary adjacency needs a connected neighbor; an all-neighbor cross path needs every neighbor. Nodes without adjacency use all listed prerequisites.": "每个职业从各自的免费起点开始。职业入口可以通过该起点连接。普通相邻连接需要一个相连的邻居；要求所有邻居的交叉路线需要每个邻居。没有相邻连接的节点需要满足全部列出的前置条件。",
  "Enhancement spends gold at the current level's price, then raises the level by one. It scales the item's base stat values and ranges by the configured percentage per level. The current runtime uses the highest configured cap without a phase check.": "强化按当前等级价格消耗金币，然后提升一级。每级按配置的百分比提升物品基础属性值及范围。当前运行逻辑使用配置的最高上限，不检查阶段。",
  "Reforge spends the listed currencies to lock one random unlocked affix. It does not reroll affixes. Price grows with the count already locked; the engraved forge keystone halves the rounded price, rounding upward. The displayed eligibility predicate and action checks are listed separately.": "重铸消耗列出的货币，随机锁定一条未锁定词缀，不会重掷词缀。价格随已锁定数量增长；铭刻锻炉关键天赋将已取整的价格减半并向上取整。界面可用条件与操作检查分别列出。",
  "Each node supplies its own allocation cost; the current costs by kind are listed below. Class origins are free. Allocation spends talent points; legacy skill points are used only when the talent-point balance is zero or negative. Refund orb costs are a separate rule.": "每个节点有各自的分配消耗，下方列出各类型的当前消耗。职业起点免费。分配消耗天赋点；仅当天赋点余额为零或负数时使用旧版技能点。退还所需宝珠消耗遵循单独规则。",
  "Enemy abilities use the exported effect, parameters, resource cost, cooldown and damage-over-time fields. Self-buffs affect their caster; enemy debuffs affect the hero. Both also strike. Healing restores the caster without a basic strike. Logical ticks last 0.5 seconds; ordinary meter telegraphs count speed-dependent action-meter fills.": "敌人技能使用导出的效果、参数、资源消耗、冷却和持续伤害字段。自身增益作用于施法者，敌人减益作用于英雄；两者均会同时攻击。治疗恢复施法者而不进行普通攻击。逻辑周期为0.5秒；普通预警计算受速度影响的行动条充满次数。",
  "Displayed points are spent talent costs. Planning is unlimited. The summary adds numeric talent effects; it does not calculate earned budgets, equipment, resonance, paid refunds or final combat stats.": "显示的点数为已花费的天赋消耗。规划不设上限。汇总将天赋数值效果相加，不计算已获得的预算、装备、共鸣、付费退还或最终战斗属性。",
  "Spend gold to raise enhancement by one level. Each level adds 5% of the original base stats. Gold prices depend on rarity, tier and enhancement level.": "消耗金币提升一级强化。每级增加原始基础属性的5%。金币价格取决于稀有度、阶级和强化等级。",
  "Spend currency to lock one random unlocked affix. Reforge does not reroll affixes or let you choose the affix. Each existing lock increases the price; Engraved Forge halves it, rounding upward.": "消耗货币随机锁定一条未锁定词缀。重铸不会重掷词缀，也不能选择要锁定的词缀。已有的每条锁定词缀都会提高价格；铭刻锻炉将价格减半并向上取整。",
  "Class origins are free. Spend talent points on connected talents. Refunds return the allocated points and require Orbs of Regret. The remaining talents must stay connected; refunded skill grants are unequipped.": "职业起点免费。消耗天赋点分配相连天赋。退还返还已分配点数并需要悔悟宝珠。剩余天赋必须保持连接，退还天赋授予的技能会被卸下。",
  "Self-buffs strengthen the creature; debuffs weaken the hero. Both also attack. Healing restores the creature without a basic attack. Cooldowns and damage-over-time use logical ticks; ordinary telegraphs use speed-dependent action-meter fills.": "自身增益强化生物，减益削弱英雄，两者均同时攻击。治疗恢复生物而不进行普通攻击。冷却与持续伤害使用逻辑周期；普通预警使用受速度影响的行动条充满次数。",
